    "description": "Key Responsibilities & Achievements:\n\nDesigned and developed automation frameworks and triggers in WPF and C#, including modules for Excel, PDF, Image, SNMP, Event, Clipboard, Timer, Screen Capture, Printer, Multimedia, ODS, and Session Actions.\n\nArchitected and implemented Plugin Factory modules, leveraging registration-free COM, improving modularity, deployment, and maintainability.\n\nEnhanced legacy Action and Trigger plug-ins, porting them to .NET while focusing on low-level system features like service and process management.\n\nDeveloped front-end GUIs using WPF and MVVM, improving usability for internal teams and customers.\n\nAutomated cloud workflows using AWS, Azure, VMware, and Dynamic CRM, and developed Health Check report modules with Excel and XML.\n\nCoordinated internal releases, delivered builds to QA teams, and supported customer-facing engineers in resolving complex technical issues.\n\nOccasionally served as Scrum Master, facilitating agile ceremonies, sprint planning, and team coordination.",
